  "description": "Sami is a university student that has a secret she can’t tell anyone. But that is about to change. After helping an older gentleman pass away, the police connects her to his death and starts to investigate her past. Detective Shin is really good at his job and is the one that discovers the truth. When he decides to interrogate the suspect, he finds a young, sexy woman that has a lot of scars. The interest is mutual but neither wants to take the first step. Has Sami finally met the man that can save her from this curse? Or will history repeat itself again? Sami doesn’t want to keep her hopes up but her life as an angel of death might finally come to an end.\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
